# 📊 SalesAnalyzer

SalesAnalyzer is a console-based sales management and analytics system developed in **C#**.

The project was built to demonstrate practical knowledge of **Object-Oriented Programming**, **Generics**, **Collections**, **LINQ**, **Repository Pattern**, **File Processing**, and **Software Architecture** while simulating a real-world sales analysis environment.

---

# 📖 About the Project

SalesAnalyzer allows users to manage companies, branches, imported sales files, products, and reports.

The application supports importing sales data from CSV and Excel files, storing and processing information, and generating analytical reports based on the imported data.

Although functional from a business perspective, the primary purpose of this project is educational and portfolio-oriented, focusing on showcasing software development concepts and best practices using C# and .NET.

---

# 🎯 Learning Objectives

This project was developed to practice and demonstrate knowledge of:

- Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
- Encapsulation
- Inheritance
- Polymorphism
- Abstraction
- Abstract Classes
- Interfaces
- Generics
- Collections
- Dictionary<TKey, TValue>
- LINQ
- Exception Handling
- Repository Pattern
- Layered Architecture
- Data Import Processing
- File Manipulation
- Software Design Principles
- Code Organization and Maintainability

---

# 🚀 Features

## Enterprise Management

- Register an enterprise
- View enterprise information

## Branch Management

- Register branches
- Remove branches
- Search branch by ID
- Search branch by name
- List all branches

## Import Management

- Import CSV files
- Import TXT files
- Import Excel files (.xlsx)
- Validate imported data
- Remove imported files

## Sales Management

- List sales
- Search sales by ID
- View sale details
- Remove sales

## Reporting

- Sales Report
- Product Report
- Category Report
- Financial Report
- Product Ranking

