# 📄 Supported File Formats

The application supports importing:

- CSV
- TXT
- XLSX

Expected structure:

```text
SALE_ID;
SALE_DATE;
PRODUCT_NAME;
PRODUCT_CATEGORY;
PRODUCT_PRICE;
PRODUCT_QUANTITY;
CATEGORY_SPECIFIC_VALUE
```

Example:

```csv
1;10/08/2025;DELL G15 NOTEBOOK;ELECTRONIC;4500.00;1;12
1;10/08/2025;RGB GAMING MOUSE;PERIPHERAL;150.00;2;USB
1;10/08/2025;OFFICE CHAIR;FURNITURE;850.00;1;LEATHER
```

Supported categories:

```text
ELECTRONIC
FURNITURE
PERIPHERAL
```

