# ▶️ Getting Started

## Prerequisites

- .NET SDK 10.0 or later
- Windows Operating System

---

## Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/guilherme-dev-code/sales-analyzer-csharp.git
```

---

## Navigate to the Project

```bash
cd sales-analyzer-csharp
```

---

## Restore Dependencies

```bash
dotnet restore
```

---

## Run the Application

```bash
dotnet run
```

---

# ⚠️ Important

This project is a **Console Application**.

All user interaction happens through the terminal.

The application does not provide a complete graphical user interface because the main goal of the project is to demonstrate:

- Object-Oriented Programming
- Generics
- LINQ
- Collections
- Repository Pattern
- File Processing
- Exception Handling
- Software Architecture
- Code Organization

The focus is on software engineering concepts rather than user interface design.

